### 5. SimulationLoop class (`Assets\Scripts\Valve\SimulationLoop.cs`) — registries
```csharp
public static SimulationLoop Instance; public static event Action OnInstanceCreated;
public List<BaseValve> allValves = new List<BaseValve>();
public List<PortBase> mainSources = new List<PortBase>();
public List<GameObject> gridInScene = new List<GameObject>();   // placed components
public GameObject currentLine;
public PneumaticTrainingCase CurrentCase;
public CustomList<caseportData> currentPostsData = new CustomList<caseportData>();
public trainType currenttrainType; public int Score = 100;

private class WireEntry { public portandvalve portAData, portBData; public string keyA, keyB; }
private readonly List<WireEntry> _wireRegistry = new List<WireEntry>();
```
- **RegisterWire(PortBase portA, PortBase portB)**: extracts portandvalve from each, builds keys, adds WireEntry, calls `RebuildGroups()`.
- **UnregisterWire(PortBase portA, PortBase portB)**: `RemoveAll` matching (bidirectional key match), `RebuildGroups()`.
- **GetPortKey(PortBase)** = `"{valve}_{port}_{gameObject.GetInstanceID()}"` — ⚠️ instanceID is NOT stable across save/load sessions; a save system must replace this with a persistent valve ID.
- **RebuildGroups()**: union-find; merges wired pairs, then merges all ports on each T_JointValve whose ports are wired (handles T-joint cascades). Builds `currentPostsData` (List of caseportData, each = List<portandvalve> nodes), only groups with ≥2 nodes.
- **DeleteAllValves()**: DeleteAllLines() first, then for each `gridInScene`: ReturnItemUI(v), `GridManagerAccessor.GridManager.DeleteObject(v)`; gridInScene.Clear(); removes from allValves.
- **DeleteAllLines()**: `_wireRegistry.Clear(); RebuildGroups();` then FindObjectsByType<linerendeler> → Destroy each.
- **RegisterValve(BaseValve)**, **ReturnItemUI(GameObject)** (increments itemUI.itemnum, decrements chazhi, UpdateUIState).
- Update loop: ResetAllPorts → 20× iteration of { ProcessLogic() per valve → ReceiveExternalInfo() per port → IntegrateAndOutput() per port }.

